focus_tool_definitions.description:
Get funding account balance (asset account). Different from account_get_balance which queries the trading account. Optionally includes total asset valuation across all account types (trading, funding, earn, etc.).

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_asset_balance(args: {
  // e.g. BTC or BTC,ETH. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Include total asset valuation breakdown by account type (trading/funding/earn). Default false.
  showValuation?: boolean;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Currency used to denominate the total asset valuation (e.g. USDT, BTC). Default USDT. Only applies when showValuation=true.
  valuationCcy?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get account balance for trading account. Returns balances for all currencies or a specific one.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_balance(args: {
  // e.g. BTC or BTC,ETH. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get account ledger: fees paid, funding charges, realized PnL, transfers, etc. Default 20 records (last 7 days), max 100.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_bills(args: {
  // Pagination: before this bill ID
  after?: string;
  // Pagination: after this bill ID
  before?: string;
  // Start time (ms)
  begin?: string;
  // e.g. USDT
  ccy?: string;
  // End time (ms)
  end?: string;
  instType?: "SPOT" | "MARGIN" | "SWAP" | "FUTURES" | "OPTION" | "EVENTS";
  // Max results (default 20)
  limit?: number;
  mgnMode?: "isolated" | "cross";
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // 1=transfer,2=trade,3=delivery,4=auto convert,5=liquidation,6=margin transfer,7=interest,8=funding fee,9=adl,10=clawback,11=sys convert,12=strategy transfer,13=ddh
  type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get archived account ledger (bills older than 7 days, up to 3 months). Use account_get_bills for recent 7-day records. Default 20 records, max 100.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_bills_archive(args: {
  // Pagination: before this bill ID
  after?: string;
  // Pagination: after this bill ID
  before?: string;
  // Start time (ms)
  begin?: string;
  // e.g. USDT
  ccy?: string;
  // End time (ms)
  end?: string;
  instType?: "SPOT" | "MARGIN" | "SWAP" | "FUTURES" | "OPTION";
  // Max results (default 20)
  limit?: number;
  mgnMode?: "isolated" | "cross";
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // 1=transfer,2=trade,3=delivery,4=auto convert,5=liquidation,6=margin transfer,7=interest,8=funding fee,9=adl,10=clawback,11=sys convert,12=strategy transfer,13=ddh
  type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get account configuration: position mode (net vs hedge), account level, auto-loan settings, etc. Note: `settleCcy` is the current settlement currency for USDS-margined contracts. `settleCcyList` is the list of available settlement currencies to choose from. These fields only apply to USDS-margined contracts and can be ignored for standard USDT/coin-margined trading.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_config(args: {
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get maximum available size for opening or reducing a position. Different from account_get_max_size which calculates new order size.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_max_avail_size(args: {
  // Margin currency. Required for isolated MARGIN mode.
  ccy?: string;
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-SWAP or BTC-USDT
  instId: string;
  // true=calculate max size for closing position
  reduceOnly?: boolean;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // cash=spot
  tdMode: "cross" | "isolated" | "cash";
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get max buy/sell order size for a SWAP/FUTURES instrument given current balance and leverage. Useful before placing orders.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_max_size(args: {
  // Margin currency. Required for isolated mode.
  ccy?: string;
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-SWAP
  instId: string;
  // Leverage (defaults to account setting)
  leverage?: string;
  // Limit order price (omit for market)
  px?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  tdMode: "cross" | "isolated";
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get maximum withdrawable amount for a currency from the trading account. Useful before initiating a transfer or withdrawal.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_max_withdrawal(args: {
  // e.g. USDT or BTC,ETH. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get current open positions across all instrument types (MARGIN, SWAP, FUTURES, OPTION, EVENTS). Use swap_get_positions for SWAP/FUTURES-only queries.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_positions(args: {
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-SWAP
  instId?: string;
  instType?: "MARGIN" | "SWAP" | "FUTURES" | "OPTION" | "EVENTS";
  posId?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get closed position history for SWAP or FUTURES. Default 20 records, max 100.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_positions_history(args: {
  // Pagination: before this timestamp (ms)
  after?: string;
  // Pagination: after this timestamp (ms)
  before?: string;
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-SWAP
  instId?: string;
  // Default SWAP
  instType?: "SWAP" | "FUTURES" | "MARGIN" | "OPTION" | "EVENTS";
  // Max results (default 20)
  limit?: number;
  mgnMode?: "cross" | "isolated";
  posId?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // 1=close long,2=close short,3=liq long,4=liq short,5=ADL long,6=ADL short
  type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get maker/taker fee rates for the account. Useful to understand your fee tier before trading.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_get_trade_fee(args: {
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-SWAP
  instId?: string;
  instType: "SPOT" | "MARGIN" | "SWAP" | "FUTURES" | "OPTION" | "EVENTS";
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Switch between net position mode and long/short hedge mode. net: one position per instrument (default). long_short_mode: separate long and short positions. [CAUTION] Requires no open positions or pending orders.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_set_position_mode(args: {
  // long_short_mode=hedge; net_mode=one-way
  posMode: "long_short_mode" | "net_mode";
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Transfer funds between accounts (trading, funding, etc.). [CAUTION] Moves real funds.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__account_transfer(args: {
  // Transfer amount
  amt: string;
  // e.g. USDT
  ccy: string;
  // Client ID (max 32 chars)
  clientId?: string;
  // Source account: 6=funding, 18=trading (unified)
  from: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Sub-account name. Required when type=1/2/3
  subAcct?: string;
  // Destination account: 6=funding, 18=trading (unified)
  to: string;
  // 0=main account (default), 1=main→sub, 2=sub→main, 3=sub→sub
  type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Check DCD order state after subscription (returns ordId + state only). For full order details (productId, strike, yield, settlement info), use dcd_get_orders instead.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__dcd_get_order_state(args: {
  // Order ID
  ordId: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get DCD order history. Yields in response are decimal fractions, not percentages.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__dcd_get_orders(args: {
  // Begin timestamp, Unix ms
  begin?: string;
  // Cursor for newer records
  beginId?: string;
  // End timestamp, Unix ms
  end?: string;
  // Cursor for older records
  endId?: string;
  // Default 100
  limit?: number;
  // Filter by order ID (overrides other filters)
  ordId?: string;
  // e.g. BTC-USDT-260327-77000-C
  productId?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Filter by state: initial | live | pending_settle | settled | pending_redeem | redeemed | rejected
  state?: string;
  // Underlying index, e.g. BTC-USD
  uly?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get DCD products with yield and quota info. Yields in response are decimal fractions, not percentages.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__dcd_get_products(args: {
  // Base currency, e.g. BTC
  baseCcy: string;
  // Option type: C (Call, sell high) or P (Put, buy low)
  optType: string;
  // Quote currency, e.g. USDT
  quoteCcy: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Redeem a DCD order early. Fetches redeem quote first, then executes. May incur early redemption penalty.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__dcd_redeem(args: {
  // DCD order ID to redeem
  ordId: string;
  // Redeem quote ID. If provided, skips the quote fetch step and uses this quote directly.
  quoteId?: string;
  // Whether to use demo trading mode or live trading mode. true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Subscribe to a Dual Currency (DCD) product. Fetches a quote first, then executes if minAnnualizedYield threshold is met.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__dcd_subscribe(args: {
  // Client order ID
  clOrdId?: string;
  // Minimum acceptable annualized yield as a percentage, e.g. 5.0 for 5%. Order will be rejected if the quoted yield is below this threshold.
  minAnnualizedYield?: number;
  // Currency of the notional size
  notionalCcy: string;
  // Notional size of the subscription
  notionalSz: string;
  // DCD product ID
  productId: string;
  // Whether to use demo trading mode or live trading mode. true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Enable or disable auto-earn for a currency. earnType='0' for auto-lend+stake (most currencies); earnType='1' for USDG earn (USDG, BUIDL). Use account_get_balance first: if autoLendStatus or autoStakingStatus != 'unsupported', use earnType='0'; for USDG/BUIDL use earnType='1'. [CAUTION] Cannot disable within 24h of enabling.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_auto_set(args: {
  // turn_on or turn_off
  action: string;
  // Currency, e.g. SOL, USDG
  ccy: string;
  // 0=auto-lend+stake (default), 1=USDG earn. Omit to use default.
  earnType?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Purchase Simple Earn Fixed product, two-step flow. First call (confirm omitted or false): returns purchase preview with product details and risk warning. YOU MUST display the warning field from the preview response to the user VERBATIM before asking for confirmation. Second call (confirm=true): executes the purchase. Only proceed after user explicitly confirms. Orders in pending state can still be cancelled via earn_fixed_redeem; once status changes to earning, funds are LOCKED until maturity and no early redemption is allowed.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_fixed_purchase(args: {
  // Purchase amount
  amt: string;
  // Currency, e.g. USDT
  ccy: string;
  // Omit or false to preview; set to true to execute after user confirms
  confirm?: boolean;
  // Whether to use demo trading mode or live trading mode. true = demo, false = live
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Term, e.g. 90D
  term: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Redeem Simple Earn Fixed (定期赚币) order. [CAUTION] Redeems a fixed-term lending order. Always redeems the full order amount. Only orders in 'pending' (匹配中) state can be redeemed — orders in 'earning' state are locked until maturity and cannot be redeemed early. Do NOT use for flexible earn redemption — use earn_savings_redeem instead.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_fixed_redeem(args: {
  // Request ID of the fixed-term order to redeem
  reqId: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get Simple Earn Fixed (定期赚币) lending order list. Returns orders sorted by creation time descending. Use this to check status of fixed-term lending orders (pending/earning/expired/settled/cancelled). Do NOT use for flexible earn balance — use earn_get_savings_balance instead. If the result is empty, do NOT display any fixed-term section in the output.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_get_fixed_order_list(args: {
  // Currency, e.g. USDT. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Order state: pending (匹配中), earning (赚币中), expired (逾期), settled (已结算), cancelled (已撤销). Omit for all.
  state?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get Flash Earn projects. Use this to browse upcoming or in-progress Flash Earn opportunities. Do NOT use for purchase or redeem actions — Flash Earn is query-only in this module.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_get_flash_earn_projects(args: {
  // Status filter. 0=upcoming, 100=in-progress. Defaults to [0,100].
  status?: Array<number>;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get personal lending records for Simple Earn (your own lending history). NOT for market rate queries. Returns your lending records with amount, rate, and earnings data.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_get_lending_history(args: {
  // Pagination: before this record ID
  after?: string;
  // Pagination: after this record ID
  before?: string;
  // e.g. USDT. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Max results (default 100)
  limit?: number;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Query Simple Earn lending rates and fixed-term offers. Use this tool when the user asks about Simple Earn products, current or historical lending rates, or when displaying savings balance with market rate context (市场均利率). Returns lending rate history (lendingRate field, newest-first) AND available fixed-term (定期) offers with APR, term, min amount, and quota — one call gives a complete view of both flexible and fixed options. In fixedOffers: lendQuota = remaining quota (剩余额度), soldOut = whether product is sold out (lendQuota is 0). To get current flexible APY: use limit=1 and read lendingRate.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_get_lending_rate_history(args: {
  // Pagination: before this timestamp (ms)
  after?: string;
  // Pagination: after this timestamp (ms)
  before?: string;
  // e.g. USDT. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Max results (default 7)
  limit?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Get Simple Earn (savings/flexible earn) balance. Returns current holdings for all currencies or a specific one. To show market rates alongside balance (市场均利率), call earn_get_lending_rate_history. earn_get_lending_rate_history also returns fixed-term (定期) product offers, so one call gives a complete view of both flexible and fixed options. Do NOT use for fixed-term (定期) order queries — use earn_get_fixed_order_list instead.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_get_savings_balance(args: {
  // e.g. USDT or BTC. Omit for all.
  ccy?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Subscribe to OKX Simple Earn (purchase savings). Moves funds from trading account to earn.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_savings_purchase(args: {
  // Amount to invest
  amt: string;
  // Currency to invest, e.g. USDT
  ccy: string;
  // Minimum lending rate, e.g. 0.01 for 1%. Defaults to 0.01.
  rate?: string;
  // Whether to use demo trading mode or live trading mode. true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Redeem from OKX Simple Earn (withdraw savings back to trading account).

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_savings_redeem(args: {
  // Amount to redeem
  amt: string;
  // Currency to redeem, e.g. USDT
  ccy: string;
  // Whether to use demo trading mode or live trading mode. true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Set lending rate for Simple Earn. [CAUTION] Changes your lending rate preference.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__earn_set_lending_rate(args: {
  // Currency, e.g. USDT
  ccy: string;
  // Minimum lending rate threshold (annual, decimal). e.g. 0.01 = 1%. Only matched when market rate ≥ this value. Keep at 0.01 to maximize matching probability — do NOT raise this to increase yield, as actual yield (lendingRate) is determined by market supply/demand, not this setting.
  rate: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Place a futures algo order: conditional (TP/SL), oco (TP+SL pair), or move_order_stop (trailing stop).

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__futures_place_algo_order(args: {
  // Activation price for trailing stop
  activePx?: string;
  // Optional 1-16 char alphanumeric AI Builder attribution code. Overrides the OKX order tag.
  aiBuilderCode?: string;
  // Callback ratio for trailing stop, e.g. 0.01 for 1%
  callbackRatio?: string;
  // Callback spread for trailing stop
  callbackSpread?: string;
  // Client-supplied order ID
  clOrdId?: string;
  // Instrument ID, e.g. BTC-USDT-240329
  instId: string;
  // Algo order type: conditional, oco, or move_order_stop
  ordType: string;
  // Position side: long or short (required in hedge mode)
  posSide?: string;
  // Whether the order can only reduce the position size
  reduceOnly?: boolean;
  // Order side: buy or sell
  side: string;
  // true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Stop-loss order price; -1 for market order
  slOrdPx?: string;
  // Stop-loss trigger price
  slTriggerPx?: string;
  // Stop-loss trigger price type: last, index, or mark
  slTriggerPxType?: string;
  // Order size in contracts
  sz: string;
  // Trade mode: cross or isolated
  tdMode: string;
  // Take-profit order price; -1 for market order
  tpOrdPx?: string;
  // Take-profit trigger price
  tpTriggerPx?: string;
  // Take-profit trigger price type: last, index, or mark
  tpTriggerPxType?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

[DEPRECATED] Use futures_place_algo_order with ordType='move_order_stop' instead. Place a futures trailing stop order (move_order_stop algo type).

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__futures_place_move_stop_order(args: {
  // Activation price; trailing starts when market reaches this price
  activePx?: string;
  // Callback ratio for trailing stop, e.g. 0.01 for 1%. Mutually exclusive with callbackSpread
  callbackRatio?: string;
  // Callback spread in price units. Mutually exclusive with callbackRatio
  callbackSpread?: string;
  // Client-supplied order ID
  clOrdId?: string;
  // Instrument ID, e.g. BTC-USDT-240329
  instId: string;
  // Position side: long or short (required in hedge mode)
  posSide?: string;
  // Whether the order can only reduce the position size
  reduceOnly?: boolean;
  // Order side: buy or sell
  side: string;
  // true = demo trading, false = live trading
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Order size in contracts
  sz: string;
  // Trade mode: cross or isolated
  tdMode: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Cancel a pending staking/DeFi purchase order. [CAUTION]

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_cancel(args: {
  // Order ID
  ordId: string;
  // staking|defi
  protocolType: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

List current active staking/DeFi investments.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_get_active_orders(args: {
  // e.g. ETH
  ccy?: string;
  // Product ID filter.
  productId?: string;
  // staking|defi
  protocolType?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // 8=pending, 13=cancelling, 9=onchain, 1=earning, 2=redeeming
  state?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

List staking/DeFi products with APY, terms, and limits. Always show protocol name (protocol field) and earnings currency (earningData[].ccy) when presenting results.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_get_offers(args: {
  // e.g. ETH
  ccy?: string;
  // Product ID filter.
  productId?: string;
  // staking|defi
  protocolType?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

List past staking/DeFi orders including redeemed ones.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_get_order_history(args: {
  // Cursor: results older than this order ID.
  after?: string;
  // Cursor: results newer than this order ID.
  before?: string;
  // e.g. ETH
  ccy?: string;
  // Max results (default 100, max 100).
  limit?: string;
  // Product ID filter.
  productId?: string;
  // staking|defi
  protocolType?: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Invest in a staking/DeFi product. [CAUTION] Moves real funds.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_purchase(args: {
  // Array of {ccy, amt} to invest.
  investData: Array<{
  amt: string;
  // e.g. ETH
  ccy: string;
}>;
  // Product ID
  productId: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
  // Order tag.
  tag?: string;
  // Investment term in days, required for fixed-term products.
