```

Redeem a staking/DeFi investment. [CAUTION] Some products have lock periods, early redemption may incur penalties.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__onchain_earn_redeem(args: {
  // Allow early exit for fixed-term products, may incur penalties. Default: false.
  allowEarlyRedeem?: boolean;
  // Order ID
  ordId: string;
  // staking|defi
  protocolType: string;
  // Set true for simulated (demo) trading. Default: false (live).
  simulatedTrading: boolean;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Amend a pending spot algo order (modify TP/SL prices or size). Also covers TP/SL orders attached when placing the main order — look up algoId via spot_get_algo_orders first.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__okx_tr__spot_amend_algo_order(args: {
  algoId: string;
  // e.g. BTC-USDT
  instId: string;
  // New SL order price, -1=market
